{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：中国宠物食品2Q26业绩不及预期，海外盈利出现变化</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">中国宠物食品和佩蒂股份在8月24日交出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>成绩单，净利润分别同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">52%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">71%</span>。GS这份覆盖报告把问题指向同一个方向：海外业务毛利率被人民币升值和原材料成本两头挤压，而国内市场竞争依然激烈，暂时看不到明确<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">拐点</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。中国宠物食品<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">31%</span>，还略<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>，但毛利率比GS预测低2.4个百分点，同比调整5.9个百分点。佩蒂股份的情况更重，毛利率<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>4.9个百分点。两家公司净利润下滑幅度都远超收入端的变化，问题出在利润结构上，而不是卖不动货。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXk1nSCUA8icAia4hK0rAJX2vkw6CcbbMBCsQBLOwsz2x6OUkGjbaJ7yC7icCVyj9x9rXRz6goy9jZZfFxSFWtTLFC3O12SX5icB1g/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 海外订单增长与利润率背离，汇率和成本同时施压</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>人民币对美元同比升值<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.9%</span>，这对以出口为主的宠物食品代工企业是直接打击。海外订单按美元计价，换算回人民币后收入缩水，同时原材料成本还在涨：鸡肉、生皮、玉米、PET价格同比分别上涨<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">43%</span>。PET是包装材料，涨幅最大，对毛利率的影响也最直接。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">中国宠物食品海外业务毛利率同比仍在调整8.9个百分点，佩蒂股份的海外业务同样<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">承压</span>。GS测算，原材料成本对两家公司单位成本的贡献分别达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.5%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.7%</span>。简单说，海外订单还在增长，但每一单赚的钱变少了。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看PET涨价<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">43%</span>这个数字，它比鸡肉和玉米的涨幅更值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>。鸡肉和玉米是主粮原料，涨价幅度温和，而PET是包装材料，涨幅接近五成，说明成本不确定性部分来自非饲料环节。后续更值得观察的是PET价格何时回落，以及企业能否通过提价向下游传导。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUPHInNn75ZCby0oqwTBnKjoSe5VHbrM2hqIfmjR4QSQyVIJbvvVY53tIsDdmOM1V6ntGUbOKetQ3ejdN3tNf0QXuoqhU0HDJo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 国内业务增速仍在调整，竞争格局没有<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>迹象</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">国内市场的表现同样不轻松。中国宠物食品国内收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>同比增长约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>，相比一季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>的增速明显回落；佩蒂股份国内收入同比下滑约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>。GS认为国内毛利率偏低是预期之内的事，但增速仍在调整叠加竞争激烈，让盈利<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>缺乏支撑。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告特别提到一个结构性变化：皇家（Royal Canin）的增速在7月加快到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">33%</span>，而<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>只有<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>。这说明国际品牌在国内市场的份额仍在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>，本土企业的竞争不确定性没有缓解。GS对<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>的判断是，成本不确定性持续，国内需求平淡，尚未看到明确的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">拐点</span>信号。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWDMJ8NrxaiaseyIrqZ1LtqCXGYJTgM01eIwib58MVmq2E56LK9ib7Urp7rnB818ic1pKiaiar6cStJdjV0hKOtQa0rVLOFZVpqkPBVI/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 盈利预测下调，但模型假设<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>开始<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS将中国宠物食品<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>盈利预测下调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>，佩蒂股份<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>盈利预测下调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">54%</span>。调整后的预测显示，中国宠物食品<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>收入增长27%，净利润下降20%；佩蒂股份收入增长7%，净利润下降36%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的是，GS在报告中假设<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>开始出现环比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。这个判断基于两个因素：一是去年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>基数较低，二是海外订单的可见度可能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>。但报告也承认，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>的汇率和成本不确定性仍在延续，7月人民币对美元同比贬值<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>，鸡肉价格同比上涨4%，改善的时点存在不确定性。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 我更关注的是GS对<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>环比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>的假设。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWf0exzp0mkpnMWTmxaRHkmG5yNXl48J0ENqWcn3qeJxRqcOfiaNCIfE40mOwhACSAwItrlMia2LVSsUGMHBQVaBo3HRUicianIcI8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 23-GS-CHINA CONSUMER STAPLES-Pet food- Earnings Review- 2Q26 miss on deteriorating overseas profitability for Rmb appreciation while domestic stays competitive-26</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
